{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">FRAME-COL function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309522","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/FRAME-COL-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/FRAME-COL-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"FRAME-COL-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">FRAME-COL function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-COL-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns a DECIMAL value that is the column\nposition of the left corner of a frame within its window.</p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\" id=\"FRAME-COL-function__note_N1002E_N10024_N10021_N10001\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Does not apply to SpeedScript programming.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-COL-function__syntax_GC17M12692765\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d440605e99\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"FRAME-COL-function__idGDL2FX2670703\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>FRAME-COL <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">frame</var> ) <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">frame</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The name of the frame whose column position you are trying to determine.\nIf you do not supply a frame name, the FRAME-COL function uses the\ndefault frame for the block it is in. If the FRAME-COL function is\nin a DO block, the function uses the default frame scoped to the\nblock containing the DO block.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-COL-function__example_GC17M22692772\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d440605e148\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure displays Customer information in one frame, then displays Order\ninformation in an overlay frame. FRAME-ROW places the overlay frame on\nthe ninth row of the second column. FRAME-COL places the overlay\nframe on the first column of the first frame.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-frcol.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"FRAME-COL-function__idGDL2FY2670710\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>FOR EACH Customer NO-LOCK:\n  DISPLAY Customer WITH FRAME cust-frame 2 COLUMNS\n    TITLE &quot;CUSTOMER INFORMATION&quot;.\n  FOR EACH Order OF Customer NO-LOCK:\n    DISPLAY Order.OrderNum Order.OrderDate Order.ShipDate Order.PromiseDate\n      Order.Carrier Order.Instructions Order.PO\n      WITH 2 COLUMNS 1 DOWN OVERLAY TITLE &quot;CUSTOMER&#39;S ORDERS&quot;\n        ROW FRAME-ROW(cust-frame) + 8 COLUMN <strong class=\"ph b\">FRAME-COL(cust-frame)</strong> + 1.\n  END.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-COL-function__notes_GC17M42692778\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d440605e186\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">The\nFRAME-COL function returns a value of 0 if the frame you specify\nis not in view when the AVM evaluates the function.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">To convert the decimal value returned by FRAME-COL to an integer value,\nuse the INTEGER function. </li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-COL-function__see-also_GC17M52692782\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d440605e201\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Frame-phrase.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Frame-phrase.html\">Frame phrase</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-DOWN-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-DOWN-function.html\">FRAME-DOWN function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-LINE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-LINE-function.html\">FRAME-LINE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-ROW-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-ROW-function.html\">FRAME-ROW function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"INTEGER-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/INTEGER-function.html\">INTEGER function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Frame-phrase.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Frame-phrase.html\">Frame phrase</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-DB-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-DB-function.html\">FRAME-DB function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309522","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"FRAME-COL function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-COL-function.html","type":"Manual"}